msgid ""
"[Inspect the WebMCP companion and Evidence Gate](webmcp/README.md) for the "
"shared tool contract, Hero Book cockpit, and qualification boundary."
msgstr ""
"[Inspect the WebMCP companion and Evidence Gate](webmcp/README.md) for the "
